                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Team Rivas joined Valley Community Healthcare in North Hollywood to learn about the services they are providing for our constituents here in CA-29.\n\n21,000 patients rely on VCH for care. Republicans' Big Ugly Bill slashes the programs, services, and care VCH provides.\n\nThis Senior Citizens Day, @HouseDemocrats and I are highlighting the importance of protecting healthcare for all seniors in the San Fernando Valley and across the country.",
