                "text": "I voted against Republicans' spending bill that raises the costs of healthcare for working families across CA-29 and the country.\n\nBecause of Republicans' bill, millions will see their premiums soar \u2013 or even lose their care all together.\n\nThis week's #RivasRewind\u23ea https://t.co/U4mSrFmBn7",
