                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "We are two days away from a Republican-led government shutdown and a worsening healthcare crisis.\n\nAn increase in healthcare costs and a lowering of coverage will make life harder for all the working families and individuals that rely on the services of these healthcare programs.\n\n@HouseDemocrats are prepared to make a deal, but Republicans keep refusing to work with us to stop their reckless cuts to healthcare.",
