                "text": "This week, Trump and Republicans shut down the government and caused healthcare premiums to soar for millions of Americans.\n\nNow, in an act of political act of retribution, they are canceling over $7.5 BILLION in energy projects across the country \u2013 including over $1.2 billion in California.\n\nThis Administration is hurting families and harming our communities' health to appease their billionaire donors.\n\nhttps://t.co/cnAt7rj9LA",
